  "details": "I've been having a problem with video players for the past half year now in vrchat. I experience lag spikes every 5-10 seconds when I put something like a YouTube video on. I expect a little lag when the video is first loaded, but to have it continue to spike every couple of seconds while it's playing has been driving me mad.\nI determined this lag was caused by video players because once I disabled them the lag spikes would stop.\nI've tired everything I could find to solve this problem to no avail and none of my friends expense this like I do, so they don't know what it could be that causes this to happen to me. If anyone could give me suggestions on how to fix this problem it would be much appreciated?!\nsome interesting experiments I've done so far:\nThe video player in 'LS Media' seems to be one of the biggest contesters to lag spike me for the entirety of a movie, while when I watch a movie in 'MOVIE & CHILL' I dont lag at all unless I put on a video myself (like a video form youtube).\nIf i get into a world that has a video playing right when you join it causes not problems, but when I or someone else puts on a video I lag spike.\nSwitching a video player from video mode to steam mode seems to stop the problem most of the time, but then I cant watch videos and I turn the video off for everyone else as well.",
